                                                "sense_id": "681e14e5-981e-3b6e-bd18-426587ef1803",
                                                "text": "The wailings of a maiden I recite, / A maiden fair, that Sparabella hight. / Such ſtrains ne'er warble in the linnet's throat, / Nor the gay goldfinch chaunts ſo ſweet a note, [...]"
